+    /*
+     * drmWaitVBlank can hand back a vblank we have already reported - it
+     * returns immediately when the requested sequence has already passed.
+     * Forwarding that repeats a timestamp, and SurfaceFlinger drops it with
+     * "Ignoring duplicate VSYNC event", which leaves its vsync predictor
+     * without a sample for that frame and shows up as stuttering animations.
+     * last_timestamp_ was already tracked here but never actually checked.
